(7638016, 1239520, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is so cute!  You must not have been too far away.  It reminds me of a shoot I did recently and I walked off and left my light stand to take pictures in another area of the property.  Several cows promptly went to investigate, knocked it over, slobbered all over it... but thankfully lost interest and walked away without crushing it.</td>', 'This is so cute!  You must not have been too far away.  It reminds me of a shoot I did recently and I walked off and left my light stand to take pictures in another area of the property.  Several cows promptly went to investigate, knocked it over, slobbered all over it... but thankfully lost interest and walked away without crushing it.', '2019-08-14 01:34:44.000000', NULL, 0),
